<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<section class="section" style="padding-top: 9rem;">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="section-header reveal-on-scroll">
      <span class="badge badge-emerald"><i data-lucide="compass"></i> About Beyounge</span>
      <h1 class="section-title">Democratizing Elite Sports Science</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.25rem;">
        We believe everyone deserves access to the same adaptive training intelligence previously reserved for Olympic and professional athletes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Story -->
    <div class="glass-card prose reveal-on-scroll" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h2>Our Story</h2>
      <p>
        Beyounge was founded in 2024 by a team of sports biomechanists, AI engineers, and competitive powerlifters who were frustrated by the state of mobile fitness apps. Existing solutions fell into two traps: rigid static routines that led to plateaus and injury, or manual logging tools that required endless typing.
      </p>
      <p>
        We set out to create an intelligent system that feels like a world-class strength coach sitting in your pocket—one that auto-regulates your workouts based on daily recovery, tracks food via computer vision, and keeps your privacy completely safe.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Core Values</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Science Above Hype:</strong> Every algorithm, rep target, and rest period is grounded in peer-reviewed exercise physiology and metabolic research.</li>
        <li><strong>Privacy First:</strong> Your biometric data, photos, and workout logs belong strictly to you. We never sell user data.</li>
        <li><strong>Seamless UX:</strong> Technology should empower your workout, not distract from it. Every UI interaction is engineered for high-speed, sub-second input in the gym.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Technology & Roadmap -->
    <div class="glass-card reveal-on-scroll" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Future Product Roadmap</h2>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <h4 style="color: var(--primary-emerald);">Q3 2026 - Health Connect & SuperSet Engine</h4>
          <p>Released! 2-way sleep sync, interactive custom supersets, and offline background database reconciliation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot" style="background: var(--accent-cyan); "></div>
          <h4 style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">Q4 2026 - Real-time Form Pose Estimation</h4>
          <p>Utilizing smartphone camera neural processing to detect squat depth, bar path, and spine alignment live during sets.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot" style="background: var(--accent-violet); "></div>
          <h4 style="color: var(--accent-violet);">Q1 2027 - iOS & WearOS Watch Apps</h4>
          <p>Expanding Beyounge to Apple Watch and WearOS for standalone wrist-based workout logging without taking your phone onto the gym floor.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

